libADLMIDI
------------------------------------------
libADLMIDI is a free MIDI to WAV conversion library with OPL3 emulation.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libADLMIDI-devel-1.6.2.1-1bl1
  libADLMIDI1-1.6.2.1-1bl1
  libSDL2_2.0_0-2.32.74-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.7-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libSDL2-devel-2.32.74-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/Wohlstand/libADLMIDI

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/Wohlstand/libADLMIDI/archive/refs/tags/v1.6.2.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libADLMIDI-1.6.2.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libADLMIDI-1.6.2.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libADLMIDI-1.6.2.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libADLMIDI-1.6.2.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libADLMIDI1-1.6.2.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libADLMIDI-devel-1.6.2.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libADLMIDI)
  /usr/bin/adlmidiplay.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libADLMIDI.README
  /usr/share/doc/libADLMIDI/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libADLMIDI/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libADLMIDI/LICENSE.GPL-3.txt
  /usr/share/doc/libADLMIDI/LICENSE.LGPL-2.1.txt
  /usr/share/doc/libADLMIDI/README.md

(libADLMIDI1)
  /usr/bin/cygADLMIDI-1.dll

(libADLMIDI-devel)
  /usr/include/adlmidi.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/libADLMIDI/libADLMIDI-shared-targets-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/libADLMIDI/libADLMIDI-shared-targets.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/libADLMIDI/libADLMIDIConfig.cmake
  /usr/lib/libADLMIDI.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libADLMIDI.pc

